From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wavjaby <devaraja1945@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:22:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] u_gralloc: link libui with the IMapper5 path

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: u_gralloc_imapper5_api.cpp calls android::GraphicBufferMapper (libui) but deps_for_u_gralloc gets dep_android_ui in no branch (the IMapper4 branch adds its dependency); a meson build of libEGL_mesa then fails with undefined GraphicBufferMapper symbols. Soong builds add libui by hand.
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
 src/util/u_gralloc/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/util/u_gralloc/meson.build b/src/util/u_gralloc/meson.build
index a4aee6f5c3f159614cd2be28c50ddb584c598f42..4f46f5db9e74d7ba5fbcd677182953490a03b0ff 100644
--- a/src/util/u_gralloc/meson.build
+++ b/src/util/u_gralloc/meson.build
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ if dep_android_ui.found()
   c_args_for_u_gralloc += '-DUSE_IMAPPER4_METADATA_API'
   cpp_args_for_u_gralloc += '-DUSE_IMAPPER4_METADATA_API'
   options_for_u_gralloc += 'cpp_std=c++17'
+  deps_for_u_gralloc += dep_android_ui
 elif dep_android_mapper4.found()
   files_u_gralloc += files('u_gralloc_imapper4_api.cpp')
   c_args_for_u_gralloc += '-DUSE_IMAPPER4_METADATA_API'
